# The nesting fixture's two shapes as Idris source, an `else if` ladder
# and a chain of non-tail calls, through the frontend: the elaborator's
# own recursion meets the depth first. Both compile at their size and at
# twice it, and no count of the work grows faster than the program.
step_limit=120
. "$IDRIS_MLIR_ROOT/harness/testutils.sh"
scale_relation nesting-source
